        "content": "**Pullback to Fib 38.2% confluence \u2014 hold, no add.** Price fell further from $52.31 (May 4) to $52.19, now sitting precisely at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement ($52.13) with 13-test horizontal support at $51.83 just below. Daily EMA alignment remains bullish (EMA-10 > EMA-21 > EMA-50). Hourly is recovering: hourly MACD histogram turned slightly positive (+0.0129), hourly EMA aligned uptrend, hourly OBV up \u2014 a tentative stabilization. R/R from hourly entry ($53.27) to target ($55.40) vs stop ($51.83) = 1.48:1, below 2:1 minimum. No add. [run `20260505_190606`]\n\n---",
